  "title": "BRAWLR",
  "description": "<p><strong>Seaguar BRAWLR High-Performance Monofilament – Advanced Knot and Tensile Strength. Low Stretch with Enhanced Sensitivity.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Seaguar BRAWLR monofilament fishing line is made with a unique resin recipe that requires an advanced level of temperature control during the manufacturing process. That’s why<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Seaguar employs an exclusive PTD process (Pinpoint Thermal Dynamics) to boost line properties and provide advanced knot &amp; tensile strength.</p>\n<h3 class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(46, 171, 163);\">IMPORTANT BRAWLR LAUNCH UPDATE</span></h3>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Seaguar BRAWLR monofilament bested all other line entries in the New Product Showcase at the 2026 I-Cast show to win the BEST in CATEGORY award for non-braided fishing lines.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Break tests show BRAWLR delivers best-in-class knot strength and tensile strength.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Elongation is minimized so BRAWLR offers less stretch than typical monofilament lines.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>This delivers significantly improved sensitivity – it helps detects more subtle bites which is a real bonus when targeting light biting species.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Fluorescent qualities enhance visibility-especially at night. The Clear Fluorescent line <span class=\"s1\">will glow in the dark.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\">Engineered and manufactured by Seaguar, the inventor and innovator of premium fishing lines.</p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/6548/5531/files/Prop65-warning_v1_480.png?v=1779996649\" alt=\"\"></p>",
